      "description": "The Heritage collection was designed in tribute to the early bags of Mulberry, which were inspired by English country pursuits. The Heritage Backpack features practical pockets, belt and buckle strap detailing and a signature logo plaque. The straps can be adjusted to a personal fit and all your belongings are secured under the front flap.",
